  <History Date="25-05-16" Author="AtlaBaseLibraryUpdater" Comment="Added AltaBase information" />
  <History Date="14-08-16" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Atlabase ID's to TOUR and TR16 modes (currently no separation of strobe modes)." />
  <History Date="14-08-16" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Moved auto and auto speed into effect group and wheel slot." />
  <History Date="11-01-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Revised Atlabase ID's with separate strobe modes." />
