  <History Date="21-12-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Changed dimmer to intensity in HSI modes and linked to vdim for compatibility" />
  <History Date="21-12-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added product thumbnail.  Added channel counts to mode names." />
